## Scoring and implementation limits
Unresolved mapping relations: 2204/3085. Every corresponding occurrence shares the same label in the uncertainty envelope. These unrestricted bounds are not probability intervals or clinically plausible adjudications.
Valid choices: 1536/1536. Invalid/missing choices score0;missing-outcome envelopes are retained. Costs: 0.654367 USD. Fixed-rule choices never use reference labels. All raw outputs remain saved.
